In 2022, the City Hall of Varginha installed new shelters and bus stops with
space-themed designs. At that time, the shelters were installed in various locations around
the city, such as: Av. Princesa do Sul, 320 - Jardim Andere; Av. Princesa do Sul, 5631;
Jardim Andere; Sesi Nave Shelter, located at Rua Dr. José Bíscaro, 634 - Nossa Sra. Aparecida;
Santa Cruz Square Shelter (Source: https://www.varginha.mg.gov.br/portal/ - Dec. 13, 2022).

